    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Cygnus_qbul.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230111021447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Cygnus qbul\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"438\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cygnus qbul.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Cygnus_qbul.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Cygnus_qbul.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230111021447\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>射手的天鹅 [白鳥の射手,</b> Hakuchō no ite<b>]</b>\n\n一位如白天鹅般美丽的女子，射箭精准而优雅。她的一箭能悄无声息地没入水中，甚至不激起一丝涟漪，也不惊动任何猎物。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bc78ece7c0f4be597efbcce4414174bf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Cygnus_Swan_of_Archery_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:110px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Cygnus_Swan_of_Archery_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" title=\"Cygnus Swan of Archery Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg (276 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:110px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/80/Cygnus_Swan_of_Archery_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/111?cb=20251114191611\" title=\"Cygnus Swan of Archery Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited 